  "summary": [
    "Build inputs, outputs and execution boundary; completion result keeps details in a file",
    "Target resolution rules: argument combinations, pattern expansion, exclusion, path normalization",
    "ID check excludes documents lacking or duplicating IDs and continues the build",
    "DLID assignment is explicitly invoked and writes only DLIDs, with duplicate originals confirmed by the user",
    "Change set records new, leaving, path change, hash change and reference change independently",
    "Section-level change detection by section ID: add, delete, move, heading, body",
    "Move detection records are kept per key and merged into the completion result",
    "Update plan reuses unchanged info; AI generates only what is needed and scripts validate",
    "Candidate checks, publishing order, and standard output contents with detail file",
    "Write units use atomic replace, no locks, and converge on rerun"
  ],
  "tasks": [
    "Implementing the build-toc operation",
    "Implementing target specification parsing and expansion",
    "Implementing DLID assignment",
    "Implementing change-set and section change detection",
    "Designing completion result output and detail files",
    "Handling build failures and reruns",
    "Reviewing write atomicity and publishing order"
  ],
